  {
   "name": "create_transfer_record",
   "description": "Create an account transfer using exact source amount/fee and destination to_amount/to_currency, authoritative ledger/source/destination IDs and optional client_uuid. IDs override names, which may be omitted when IDs are supplied. Dates require offsets. Different account currencies require the exact received amount and destination currency; exchange_rate must be omitted or 1 and never determines received money. Returns the full row. Reuse request_id with identical arguments for a quota-free completed retry. Reusing client_uuid with a fresh request_id prevents another row but remains a separately metered action.\n\nSelect the destination with space_id from list_spaces and preserve it on retries.",
   "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
     "body": {
      "type": "object",
